OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies charge over Manchester
OL,4,Asynagogue attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied failing to disclose
OL,7,Finformation in relation to the
OL,8,FManchester synagogue attack.
OL,10,FHekmat Omar Ali Hakim appeared before
OL,11,FWestminster Magistrates' Court and
OL,12,Fpleaded not guilty to failing to
OL,13,Fdisclose information regarding
OL,14,Fterrorist activity.
OL,16,FThe 49-year-old, of St James Road in
OL,17,FHigher Broughton, Salford, spoke only
OL,18,Fto confirm his name and indicate his
OL,19,Fplea. He was remanded into custody to
OL,20,Fappear at at the Old Bailey on 25
OL,21,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
