OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies charge over Manchester
OL,4,Asynagogue attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorshippers Melvin Cravitz and Adrian
OL,7,FDaulby were killed when Jihad
OL,8,FAl-Shamie, 35, a Syrian-born British
OL,9,Fcitizen, drove into the gates of the
OL,10,FHeaton Park Hebrew Congregation
OL,11,FSynagogue on 2 October.
